flowchart LR
  DB[(Canonical workspace)] --> SNAP[Consistent snapshot]
  FILES[(Attachment store)] --> HASH[Hash and manifest]
  SNAP --> HASH
  HASH --> BUNDLE[Versioned backup bundle]
  BUNDLE --> VERIFY[Verify checksums and schema]
  VERIFY --> PREVIEW[Restore preview]
  PREVIEW --> STAGE[New workspace staging]
  STAGE --> COMPARE[Integrity comparison]
  COMPARE --> RESTORED[(Restored workspace)]
